    "body": "## Problem\n\n:terminal height changes when entering cmdline-mode, if `cmdline=0` with ui2.\nthis causes some :terminal output to be lost.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n```\nnvim --clean -c \"lua require'vim._core.ui2'.enable()\" -c \"se cmdheight=0\" -c 'te bash -c \"while true; do echo $LINES; sleep 0.3; done\"'\n```\nthen enter cmdline-mode, the value printed change.\n\n## Expected behavior\n\n:terminal height not changing\n\n## System info\n\n- Nvim version (nvim -v): `v0.13.0-dev-1738 g521eddec7c` neovim/neovim@521eddec7c\n- Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?: no\n- Operating system/version: Windows_NT 10.0.26200\n- Terminal name/version: unknown\n- $TERM environment variable: `unknown`\n- Installation: msi",
